      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-04-13_WidnesExaminer_art0011" n="art0011">
        <head>BOON TO LADIES.</head>
        <p>A BOON TO LADIES.</p>
        <p>COLLINS' MARVELLOUS FEMALE REMEDY. Mr. COLLINS (who was 30 years a menatrer of the Royal College of Surgeons of England) will forward, free of Charge, full PARTICULARS of a REMEDY, which during an extensive practice, both at home and In the Colonies, he has never known to tail In the most OBSTINATE CASES of 1433TRUCTION and IRREGULARITI RS. Send ad2ressed envelope for full particulars, and waste no more time and money on useless Pills and so.sdled Remedies, , which. In the majority of cases, are nothing hut rim.' GAMES, and cause SICKNESS. PROSTRATION. and PAIN, without having the desired effect. Letters to be addressed:</p>
        <p>D. COLLINS, Gothic House, 9, Erskine Street. Liverpool</p>
